---
import Header from "../components/header.astro";

const facebookUrl = "https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61588407723104";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>The Mobile Difference | Eyeglass Wearhouse1, LLC</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Learn how Eyeglass Wearhouse1, LLC brings mobile eyewear service to homes, facilities, senior communities, and clients."
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <section class="difference-hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">The Mobile Difference</p>
          <h1>Eyewear service that comes to the client.</h1>
          <p>
            Eyeglass Wearhouse1, LLC makes eyewear access easier by bringing
            frame selection, fitting support, and eyeglass service directly to
            facilities, senior communities, homes, and local clients.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/catalog" class="primary-button">View Catalog</a>
            <a href={facebookUrl} target="_blank" class="secondary-button">
              Message on Facebook
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card">
          <img src="/logo.jpg" alt="Eyeglass Wearhouse1 LLC logo" />
          <p>Mobile eyewear visits</p>
          <strong>Convenient. Personal. Facility-friendly.</strong>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="story-section">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow blue">Why Mobile Eyewear</p>
          <h2>For many clients, getting to an optical store is the hardest part.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="story-copy">
          <p>
            Traditional eyewear shopping can be difficult for clients with
            limited transportation, busy schedules, mobility challenges, or
            facility-based care. A mobile eyewear service removes that barrier.
          </p>

          <p>
            Instead of asking every client to come to the store, Eyeglass
            Wearhouse1, LLC brings the service closer to where people already
            are.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="process-section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow blue">How It Works</p>
          <h2>A simpler eyewear experience.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="process-grid">
          <article>
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Schedule a Visit</h3>
            <p>
              Coordinate a visit for a home, facility, senior living community,
              care center, or local event.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Bring the Frames</h3>
            <p>
              Clients can browse available frame options without needing to
              travel to a traditional optical location.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Help With Fit & Selection</h3>
            <p>
              Support is provided to help clients choose frames based on
              comfort, style, use case, and everyday needs.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>04</span>
            <h3>Serve Multiple Clients</h3>
            <p>
              Facility visits can make eyewear service more convenient for
              multiple residents or clients in one organized appointment window.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="split-section">
        <div class="image-panel">
          <img src="/heronew.png" alt="Mobile eyewear service" />
        </div>

        <div class="split-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow blue">Built for Facilities</p>
          <h2>Helpful for senior communities, care centers, and group visits.</h2>
          <p>
            Mobile visits are especially useful for facilities that want to make
            eyeglass access easier for residents or clients. Instead of
            coordinating transportation for each person, the eyewear service can
            come directly to the location.
          </p>

          <div class="feature-list">
            <div>
              <strong>Less travel</strong>
              <span>Clients can receive help closer to where they live.</span>
            </div>

            <div>
              <strong>Organized visits</strong>
              <span>Facilities can plan a convenient appointment day.</span>
            </div>

            <div>
              <strong>Personal support</strong>
              <span>Frame selection can be handled in a calmer setting.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="benefits-section">
        <div class="section-heading centered">
          <p class="eyebrow blue">The Difference</p>
          <h2>Not just glasses. A more convenient way to get them.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-grid">
          <article>
            <h3>Convenience First</h3>
            <p>
              The service is designed around accessibility and fewer obstacles
              for clients.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Catalog-Based Selection</h3>
            <p>
              Frames can be organized by brand, model, color, gender, and price
              to make choosing easier.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Facility-Friendly</h3>
            <p>
              A practical option for senior living locations, care facilities,
              and community service days.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="quote-section">
        <p>
          The goal is simple: make eyewear service easier to access for the
          people who need it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="cta-section">
        <p class="eyebrow">Ready to Learn More?</p>
        <h2>Schedule a mobile eyewear visit or ask about facility service.</h2>

        <div class="hero-actions center">
          <a href="/contact" class="primary-button">Contact Us</a>
          <a href={facebookUrl} target="_blank" class="secondary-button">
            Facebook Page
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    font-family:
      Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    background: #f8f6f0;
    color: #17202a;
  }

  a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .difference-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 680px;
    padding: 6rem 8%;
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(18, 61, 99, 0.78), rgba(18, 61, 99, 0.78)),
      url("/hero-bg.jpg");
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    color: white;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #d8ecff;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .eyebrow.blue {
    color: #1f5f94;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 6.7rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
  }

  .hero-copy p {
    max-width: 720px;
    color: #eef7ff;
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-actions.center {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .primary-button,
  .secondary-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 1.35rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .primary-button {
    background: white;
    color: #1f5f94;
  }

  .secondary-button {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    color: white;
  }

  .hero-card {
    justify-self: end;
    width: min(420px, 100%);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 36px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
    box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  }

  .hero-card img {
    width: 170px;
    max-width: 80%;
    display: block;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: white;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-card p {
    color: #d8ecff;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-card strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .story-section,
  .split-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 5rem 8%;
    background: white;
  }

  .story-section h2,
  .section-heading h2,
  .split-copy h2,
  .cta-section h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    color: #17202a;
  }

  .story-copy p,
  .split-copy p,
  .benefit-grid p {
    color: #52606d;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .process-section,
  .benefits-section {
    padding: 5rem 8%;
  }

  .section-heading {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-heading.centered {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .process-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.3rem;
  }

  .process-grid article,
  .benefit-grid article {
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: white;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(31, 95, 148, 0.08);
  }

  .process-grid article span {
    color: #1f5f94;
    font-weight: 950;
  }

  .process-grid h3,
  .benefit-grid h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    color: #17202a;
  }

  .process-grid p {
    color: #52606d;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .split-section {
    background: #f8f6f0;
  }

  .image-panel {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 36px;
    min-height: 480px;
    background: white;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(31, 95, 148, 0.12);
  }

  .image-panel img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 480px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .feature-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .feature-list div {
    padding: 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: white;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(31, 95, 148, 0.07);
  }

  .feature-list strong {
    display: block;
    color: #1f5f94;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .feature-list span {
    color: #52606d;
  }

  .benefit-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .quote-section {
    padding: 5rem 8%;
    text-align: center;
    background: white;
  }

  .quote-section p {
    max-width: 950px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: #1f5f94;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .cta-section {
    padding: 5rem 8%;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #123d63, #1f5f94);
    color: white;
  }

  .cta-section h2 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    color: white;
  }

  .cta-section .primary-button {
    background: white;
    color: #1f5f94;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1050px) {
    .difference-hero,
    .story-section,
    .split-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero-card {
      justify-self: start;
    }

    .process-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .benefit-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .difference-hero,
    .story-section,
    .process-section,
    .split-section,
    .benefits-section,
    .quote-section,
    .cta-section {
      padding-left: 6%;
      padding-right: 6%;
    }

    .process-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .image-panel,
    .image-panel img {
      min-height: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>